      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2430033607,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Just confirmed, you can buy the CMP standard. You need to give them your information for getting the price list though. CMP is a bit pricey, compared to IEEE.\n\nAs CMP solves the same problem and is somewhat based on TECMP, you might save your money and just look at TECMP for understanding, what those standards do.",
