      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2430199492,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> I find ISO very frustrating as the standards are split often in a lot of small documents. While each document does not cost much, it adds up quite quickly.\n\nISO/IEC 1064723717-23: Frobozz remote monitoring protocol: encoding for packets transmitted on 29 February of years that are divisible by 400 sent over 802.3 10BASE5 with a broken vampire tap",
