      "title": "TECMP/CMP: fix decoding issue for LIN go to sleep",
      "message": "TECMP/CMP: fix decoding issue for LIN go to sleep\n\nLIN encodes \"go to sleep\" frames by using ID 0x3C and setting first byte\nto 0x00. This patches allows to detect this correctly.\n\nCloses: #20463\n",
      "author_name": "Dr. Lars Völker",
      "author_email": "lars.voelker@technica-engineering.de",
      "authored_date": "2025-03-31T23:29:49.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
